{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Rise of the Penguins 2: Penguin's Dark Ascent",
    "steam_appid": 3597710,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597710/extras/29156d29ca9a05c3771e93b716e69410.poster.avif?t=1745531912\" width=712 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597710/extras/29156d29ca9a05c3771e93b716e69410.webm?t=1745531912\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597710/extras/29156d29ca9a05c3771e93b716e69410.mp4?t=1745531912\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by my first game 'Rise of the Penguins GB', 'Rise of the Penguins 2: Penguin's Dark Ascent' is a 2D Side-Scrolling Action-Platformer meant to feel like Rise of the Penguins GB but a more modern interpretation. Player's get to play as a penguin named Kaito who challenges the Crimson Star cult that is a group that was formed when the world went into Eternal Dusk and is preventing the red star from being reactivated causing unrest throughout the penguin community. Along the journey there are a few allies Kaito will meet that provide some dialogue for the player to interact with that is mostly optional. The story is meant to be brief and not hinder eager players that just want to play the game. Well at the same time giving a timeline to the events that occurred in the first game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >about ROP 2</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >estimated 6-8 levels in final version</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >each level has a mini boss and boss</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >variety of fun mechanics in each level</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >different enemies in each level </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >variety of strange penguin amalgamations and other deadly foes </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >satisfying blood as you kill enemies throughout the level </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >basic parry projectile mechanics</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >obtain items from Corvus and perks from Maven</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >consume mana to use items</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >apply a perk for a little buff  </p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597710/extras/29156d29ca9a05c3771e93b716e69410.poster.avif?t=1745531912\" width=712 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597710/extras/29156d29ca9a05c3771e93b716e69410.webm?t=1745531912\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597710/extras/29156d29ca9a05c3771e93b716e69410.mp4?t=1745531912\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by my first game 'Rise of the Penguins GB', 'Rise of the Penguins 2: Penguin's Dark Ascent' is a 2D Side-Scrolling Action-Platformer meant to feel like Rise of the Penguins GB but a more modern interpretation. Player's get to play as a penguin named Kaito who challenges the Crimson Star cult that is a group that was formed when the world went into Eternal Dusk and is preventing the red star from being reactivated causing unrest throughout the penguin community. Along the journey there are a few allies Kaito will meet that provide some dialogue for the player to interact with that is mostly optional. The story is meant to be brief and not hinder eager players that just want to play the game. Well at the same time giving a timeline to the events that occurred in the first game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >about ROP 2</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >estimated 6-8 levels in final version</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >each level has a mini boss and boss</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >variety of fun mechanics in each level</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >different enemies in each level </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >variety of strange penguin amalgamations and other deadly foes </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >satisfying blood as you kill enemies throughout the level </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >basic parry projectile mechanics</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >obtain items from Corvus and perks from Maven</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >consume mana to use items</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >apply a perk for a little buff  </p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Dive into 'Rise of the Penguins 2: Penguin's Dark Ascent' a thrilling 2D action-platformer where you battle bosses, throw snowballs, and challenge the Crimson Star cult in a world shrouded in Eternal Dusk.",
